{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-title='Apache Tomcat'>\r\n\t\t\tApache Tomcat\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Logging: WEB-INF\\Classes\\ and Separate per context.","label":"Logging","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/locations","label":"Locations","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/locations"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/multiple","label":"Multiple","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/multiple"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>WEB-INF\\Classes\\<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLogging.properties.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOrg.apache.catalina.core.ContainerBase.[Catalina].level = INFO.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOrg.apache.catalina.core.ContainerBase.[Catalina].handlers = java.util.logging.ConsoleHandler.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Separate per context<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Each application must use its own log4j.jar in WEB-INF\/lib of each application.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>2. In each log4j's configuration file (default location is WEB-INF\/classes), specify the log file name, e.g. log4j.appender.AppLog.File=${catalina.home}\/logs\/app1.log.<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Add swallowOutput=\"true\" for each context so stdout, stderr will go to your own log.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/logging\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/logging\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/locations' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/locations' data-title='Locations' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Locations<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/multiple' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat\/multiple' data-title='Multiple' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Multiple<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_tomcat' data-title='Apache Tomcat'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/program\/apache_tomcat.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Apache Tomcat<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}